WEBVTT

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:10.440
Future Plans

00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:13.030
What I want to do, huh?

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:17.870
I don't know what I 
want to do in the future.

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:21.250
Ah, hell...

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:24.370
What are you all worried about?

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.400
How about talking to the cutie 
here about your problems?

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:30.960
A mermaid wouldn't understand.

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:39.490
Have you ever worried about what 
might happen in the future?

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:40.680
The future?

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:43.110
What's thinking about the 
future gonna get you?

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:45.440
Actually, by future, how 
many years are we talking?

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:48.190
I told you a mermaid wouldn't get it.

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:53.030
Humans have to plan a lot of things 
when they live their lives.

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:57.320
That's what you're lost in thought about?

00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:00.460
Thinking about that sort of 
stuff is just a waste of time.

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:01.990
Let's have fun together instead.

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:03.370
Wait—

00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:04.630
Jump!

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:05.840
What?!

00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:15.840
What are you doing?!

00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:20.040
Just relax and take it easy.

00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:23.350
You'll only drown faster
if you struggle too much.

00:01:23.710 --> 00:01:26.010
It's better to do nothing at all instead.

00:01:26.690 --> 00:01:30.050
Humans have to do lots of 
things in a short lifetime.

00:01:30.050 --> 00:01:31.460
Of course it's gonna be busy.

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:34.780
But sometimes it's also important

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:37.420
to just float on the water and 
let the current carry you.

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:39.990
You need to ensure you let your body

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:42.320
and your mind rest 
before you start to swim.

00:01:44.190 --> 00:01:45.940
It's okay to take your time.

00:01:45.940 --> 00:01:48.040
Take a look around, and when you find

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:49.670
a shore that you want to visit,

00:01:49.670 --> 00:01:51.700
then you can swim for it as hard as you can.

00:01:53.930 --> 00:01:56.070
What if I don't find a shore?

00:01:56.070 --> 00:01:59.260
Huh? Uh, then you can 
just stay floating there!

00:01:59.710 --> 00:02:02.090
Just staying afloat takes a lot 
of energy too, you know.

00:02:02.440 --> 00:02:05.050
Anyway, your analogy has 
a lot of holes in it.

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:09.640
I thought that was pretty good.

00:02:11.270 --> 00:02:12.560
But,

00:02:13.350 --> 00:02:15.530
I guess it did give me a few hints.

00:02:23.270 --> 00:02:25.490
Also, M-Muromi-san...

00:02:25.490 --> 00:02:29.520
Humans don't swim in the ocean in winter.

00:02:29.520 --> 00:02:32.290
It was perfect to get you to chill out, though.

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:49.060
There she is.

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:52.290
Hey, Muromi-san!

00:02:53.140 --> 00:02:55.640
Mer...

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:55.640
What are you doing?

00:02:56.510 --> 00:02:57.940
I'm a Merlion.

00:02:57.940 --> 00:02:59.280
Lame.

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:00.710
Hey, don't just say that!

00:03:00.710 --> 00:03:02.910
Think about the work I put in for that joke!

00:03:03.270 --> 00:03:05.680
Why the comedy routine?

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:07.900
It's the season for end of the year parties.

00:03:07.900 --> 00:03:10.580
I was thinking about what joke 
I should tell at the party.

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:13.880
I thought it was disgusting 
more than funny.

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:16.300
Really?! I thought it was pretty good!

00:03:16.690 --> 00:03:19.690
You're always so critical,

00:03:19.690 --> 00:03:22.830
but what about you, Takkun? 
Can you do something funny?

00:03:22.830 --> 00:03:24.760
I can't, so I won't.

00:03:25.230 --> 00:03:27.540
You're boring.

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:30.150
Aren't you going to an end of the year party?

00:03:30.150 --> 00:03:33.770
Oh yeah, I think my class is 
having a Christmas party.

00:03:33.770 --> 00:03:37.670
Oh, the day people in Japan 
use as an excuse to get it on.

00:03:37.670 --> 00:03:39.110
That's some prejudice.

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:43.260
W-Wait, is this "Christmas party" of 
yours really some sort of orgy

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:45.060
you're planning on attending?!

00:03:45.060 --> 00:03:46.590
It's a normal party.

00:03:46.590 --> 00:03:48.320
But your chastity...

00:03:48.320 --> 00:03:50.080
I said it was a normal party!

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:52.660
Well, if you say so.

00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:59.430
Maybe it'd be better if it 
was more of a fountain.

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:05.480
Muromi-san, you can have this.

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:07.100
Hm? What is it?

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:09.590
I made it out of a broken fishing hook.

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:14.060
It'd be weird if I put it 
on, so I'll give it to you.

00:04:15.390 --> 00:04:18.980
Hey, is this a Christmas present?

00:04:19.870 --> 00:04:21.080
I dunno, but...

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:28.130
You helped me feel somewhat 
better the other day, so...

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:32.220
How about we have an orgy of our own?

00:04:32.220 --> 00:04:33.260
Where did that come from?!

00:04:33.260 --> 00:04:36.460
But you giving me a 
Christmas present means...

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:38.380
That's not why I gave it to you.

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:40.670
Then why did you give it to me?!

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:42.910
I'm gonna go insane if 
you keep leading me on!

00:04:42.910 --> 00:04:45.940
You need to stop toying 
with women's hearts!

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:47.550
I'm not toying with anything!

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:50.510
Also, take off this mask!

00:04:55.740 --> 00:04:57.650
<b>End of the Year Party</b>

00:04:55.740 --> 00:04:57.650
<b>This way</b>

00:04:55.740 --> 00:05:00.110
She's gonna do it, she's gonna do it!

00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:04.100
Mer...

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:05.470
Merlion.

00:05:08.130 --> 00:05:10.800
She did it!

00:05:16.130 --> 00:05:19.960
<i>Takkun just doesn't have the 
same sense of humor we do.</i>

00:05:20.490 --> 00:05:21.960
Muromi-san.

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:28.300
They're ringing the New Year's bell.

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:33.140
It feels like it was just summer 
and then fall not too long ago,

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:34.890
but now it's already a new year.

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:37.350
Now, now, now...

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:41.260
Happy New Year!

00:05:41.590 --> 00:05:43.030
Year!

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:48.740
It's hot...

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:52.950
I guess you can't handle the heat 
because you're always in cold places?

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:56.330
You can get out if you need to, Yetchi.

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:57.920
I think I will.

00:05:58.770 --> 00:06:01.240
She didn't take off her hide even to bathe.

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:03.980
So maybe she can't take it off, then?

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:05.630
Maybe nobody bathes naked
 where she comes from?

00:06:05.630 --> 00:06:07.720
Harpy took off her clothes, though.

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:08.830
Well, whatever's the case,

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:12.550
the fact that she doesn't just up and 
attack us anymore is good progress.

00:06:12.550 --> 00:06:14.600
Yetchi really taught her well.

00:06:16.070 --> 00:06:18.330
Fuji-san, have you been in too long?

00:06:19.720 --> 00:06:22.700
Muromi-san's hot flesh...

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:25.420
So sexy...

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:32.410
What?

00:06:32.890 --> 00:06:34.260
I did invite you,

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:36.720
but I never thought you'd actually come.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:40.040
Even I like to take it easy on 
New Year's, you know?

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:43.540
Dolphins, the hot springs 
feel good, don't they?

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:48.220
Oh yeah, where did Levia-san go?

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:50.080
She said the hot springs 
weren't hot enough,

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:52.150
so she headed for Sakura Island.

00:06:52.150 --> 00:06:54.850
The lava's warm.

00:06:55.450 --> 00:06:58.420
Hi, everyone. How was the water?

00:06:58.420 --> 00:06:59.790
Houman-san!

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:01.210
It was a good bath.

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:04.360
It might have been too 
hot for Yetchi, though.

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:07.050
Oh my, did you get dizzy from the heat?

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:08.490
I'm fine.

00:07:09.750 --> 00:07:11.200
It was okay.

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:13.560
Hiichan had a great time!

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:16.100
The dolphins had a lot of fun, too!

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:19.150
Oh, Houman-san.

00:07:19.150 --> 00:07:21.290
Watch out for that bird over there.

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:23.440
She might come after you 
thinking you're a snake.

00:07:24.450 --> 00:07:26.700
Don't attack her, Harpy.

00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:28.050
I don't mind.

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:30.380
Hawks grab me and take 
me away quite often.

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:31.720
You should mind!

00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:34.560
Anyway, we've warmed ourselves up.

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:39.310
Let's head to a place where we can 
watch the first sunrise of the year.

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:41.360
Yeah!

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:51.580
M-Muromi-san and the others 
are taking their time.

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:52.560
Yeah.

00:07:54.190 --> 00:07:56.890
I-I wonder what they're doing.

00:07:56.890 --> 00:07:57.770
Dunno.

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:01.570
<i>I can't take it anymore!</i>

00:08:01.570 --> 00:08:03.240
<i>Muromi-san, hurry up!</i>

00:08:03.240 --> 00:08:05.170
Hey, Takkun!

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:07.170
Kawabata-kun!

00:08:08.060 --> 00:08:09.190
Muromi-san!

00:08:09.190 --> 00:08:11.330
Huh? Why are you crying?

00:08:11.330 --> 00:08:13.200
I'm not crying.

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:14.440
You took forever!

00:08:14.440 --> 00:08:15.890
Sorry, sorry.

00:08:16.570 --> 00:08:18.320
Hey, Kawabata-kun.

00:08:18.320 --> 00:08:19.850
We gonna pound some mochi?

00:08:20.480 --> 00:08:22.530
I wanted to eat some when the sun rose.

00:08:28.330 --> 00:08:32.100
Dolphins, get away from Levia-san!

00:08:36.050 --> 00:08:37.450
Sorry I'm late.

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:40.130
Levia-san, you're just in time.

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:42.560
You're burning up.

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:44.670
Was the lava bath good?

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:46.130
Lava bath?!

00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:49.130
I would have liked it better 
if it was just a bit hotter.

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:51.360
Oh, Otohime's here too.

00:08:51.360 --> 00:08:53.170
You're gonna burn me, so stay away!

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:56.510
You're going to do some mochi pounding? 
I wanna do it too!

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:58.260
You're gonna break it, so no!

00:08:58.910 --> 00:09:00.540
Don't touch it. It'll catch on fire.

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:01.640
Boo...

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:03.190
Mochi! Mochi!

00:09:03.190 --> 00:09:05.550
Harpy, wait just a little longer.

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:09.150
Yetchi, you haven't done 
this before, right?

00:09:09.410 --> 00:09:10.500
Give it a try.

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:14.400
You use this hammer to 
knead the mochi dough.

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:17.360
I'll give it a try.

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:19.110
All right. It's ready.

00:09:27.510 --> 00:09:31.210
Takkun, let's have a good year.

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:35.800
Yeah, let's.

00:09:38.750 --> 00:09:40.370
All right, Yeti.

00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:42.600
Give it a good one!

00:09:42.960 --> 00:09:44.580
One, two...

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:57.400
<b>Knocked into the ground</b>

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:11.340
<b>Happy New Year</b>

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:15.090
H-Happy New—

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:16.500
The end.

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:20.050
<b>The End</b>

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:31.480
<b>Episode 13
"The Years Go By Muromi-san"</b>

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:31.480
<b>Muromi-san on the Shore</b>
